. Automatically fill columns, increase rewards, slow down time, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine their effects to create devastating synergies during your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933120/extras/1fe90d55107c8eea7050b413485991fd.poster.avif?t=1769031966\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933120/extras/1fe90d55107c8eea7050b413485991fd.webm?t=1769031966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933120/extras/1fe90d55107c8eea7050b413485991fd.mp4?t=1769031966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perish and retry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake, every wasted second comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is inevitable, but each run is a new opportunity. Start over, gather new treasures, refine your strategy, and manage your time carefully to go further than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933120/extras/b7f8df442017f4cfe1b616aa4962f39b.poster.avif?t=1769031966\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933120/extras/b7f8df442017f4cfe1b616aa4962f39b.webm?t=1769031966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933120/extras/b7f8df442017f4cfe1b616aa4962f39b.mp4?t=1769031966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","developers":["Hydrobates"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"2